Check that the review was done within the review period, that its results are recorded, and that the compliance register shows the results.

{{#if this.craGuidance}}
== EU Cyber Resilience Act

Follow the delegated and implementing acts of the CRA (Regulation (EU) 2024/2847), the harmonised standards, and the guidance of the European Commission and ENISA. The reporting obligations apply from 11 September 2026, and the other obligations of manufacturers apply from 11 December 2027.
{{/if}}

